  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Keep On The Sunny Side** (1 other source): Last played 2021-11-16, a gap of 230 shows before this performance [1]\n- **Will The Circle Be Unbroken** (1 other source): Last played 2022-10-29, 125 shows earlier; the notes also flag a jam on Dylan's \"Don't Think Twice\" [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Crawdad Hole**: back after 149 archived shows (779 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Ain't Gonna Work Tomorrow**: back after 160 archived shows (808 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Maggie Walker Blues**: back after 107 archived shows (562 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Wild Bill Jones**: back after 70 archived shows (419 days) [3]\n- **I'm Troubled**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Mountain Dew**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Big Sciota**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Uncloudy Day**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-12-29.mk22** (recommended): source not stated; 31 songs; 148 min [1]\n- **billystrings2023-12-29**: source not stated; 31 songs; 150 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-12-29.mk22**: taped by Swamprat; source: Schoeps MK22 (Din) @ 10'-> Zoom F3 @ 32 Bit Float [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK22 mics in DIN placement at 10 feet, into a Zoom F3 at 32-bit float; SD to hard drive, then Reaper and Ozone 11 [1]\n- **billystrings2023-12-29**: taped by Flynn; transferred by Flynn; source: (FOB,LOC) Schoeps MSTC64U > Sonosax SX-M2D2 > SDMP6ii @ 32 Bit [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Billy Strings December 29 2023 Uno Lakefront Arena New Orleans LA Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-december-29-2023-uno-lakefront-arena-new-orleans-la-poster) [4]\n- Fan art by tela.sugarmegs.org: [Sugarmegs Audio Setlist](https://tela.sugarmegs.org/_asxtela/asxcards/BillyStrings2023-12-29LakefrontArenaNOLA.html) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-12-29 UNO Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-12-29-uno-lakefront-regular/) [6]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-12-29 UNO Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-12-29-uno-lakefront-regular/) [7]",
